<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">hikarabita kotoba wo tsunai de</font></font></b></font></font>

4
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">connecting old words that have<font color="#ffffff"> been used up</font></font></font></b></font></font>

5
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo bokura shinpuru na omoi wo tsutaetai dake na no</font></font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:39,490 --> 00:01:41,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't forget your objective...</font>

26
00:01:44,410 --> 00:01:45,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't go!</font>

27
00:01:48,330 --> 00:01:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you...</font>

28
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

29
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:06,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Gather!</font>

30
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:06,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Iron-Wall Formation</font>

31
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:11,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's already four o'clock
in the morning...</font>

32
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:14,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Fifth Hokage is
a real slave driver.</font>

33
00:02:14,820 --> 00:02:17,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She ought to retrieve
the documents she forgot herself...</font>

34
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:24,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... What's the matter?</font>

35
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wake up!</font>

36
00:02:29,330 --> 00:02:31,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll catch cold if you sleep
in a place like this.</font>

37
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you...</font>

38
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh!</font>

39
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

40
00:03:08,330 --> 00:03:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work...</font>

41
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:15,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fifth Hokage! You were asleep
just now, weren't you?</font>

42
00:03:15,250 --> 00:03:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you made us
go to fetch the documents!</font>

43
00:03:17,630 --> 00:03:19,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And only you got to sleep!</font>

44
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:23,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly Hokage-sama</font>

45
00:03:23,300 --> 00:03:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's something
I want to report to you.</font>

46
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

47
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you just say?!</font>

48
00:03:31,810 --> 00:03:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that true?!</font>

49
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:34,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

50
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to Haruno Sakura,
it appears that there's no mistake...</font>

51
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:44,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unbelievable...
That they should already be on the move...</font>

52
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In addition to getting what I want...</font>

53
00:03:49,450 --> 00:03:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time I will completely
destroy Leaf Village.</font>

54
00:03:57,090 --> 00:03:59,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what that pervert wants...</font>

55
00:04:01,380 --> 00:04:03,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the Uchiha's powers, huh...</font>

56
00:04:05,890 --> 00:04:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Izumo! Kotetsu!</font>

57
00:04:07,890 --> 00:04:09,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's somebody
I want you to bring here!</font>

58
00:04:12,850 --> 00:04:17,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and eat, Shikamaru!
Your Dad's mission starts today too!</font>

59
00:04:17,650 --> 00:04:20,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's not that much time
for morning training!</font>

60
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, okay.</font>

61
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One okay is enough!</font>

62
00:04:24,990 --> 00:04:27,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nag, nag, nag from early
in the morning...</font>

63
00:04:29,790 --> 00:04:32,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder who it could be
so early in the morning?</font>

64
00:04:34,870 --> 00:04:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... Dad...</font>

65
00:04:36,790 --> 00:04:37,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

66
00:04:38,130 --> 00:04:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you marry
a hard-edged woman like Mom?</font>

67
00:04:43,130 --> 00:04:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see now...</font>

68
00:04:45,090 --> 00:04:48,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though Mom's like that
she smiles gently sometimes...</font>

69
00:04:48,810 --> 00:04:50,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe that's why...</font>

70
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that the only reason?</font>

71
00:04:58,150 --> 00:04:59,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru!</font>

72
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A messenger of the Fifth Hokage
is here.</font>

73
00:05:07,780 --> 00:05:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke apparently slipped out
of the village late last night.</font>

74
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:14,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... there is almost no mistake</font>

75
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that he is headed for
the Village Hidden in the Sound!</font>

76
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Slipped out?! Why...</font>

77
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:23,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because he was enticed by
that Orochimaru!</font>

78
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:27,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-W-Wait a minute!</font>

79
00:05:28,470 --> 00:05:32,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why does Sasuke have to be enticed
by a risky guy like that?!</font>

80
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:37,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason doesn't matter.
In any case there's no time.</font>

81
00:05:38,020 --> 00:05:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will perform your first mission
as a Chunin...</font>

82
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:45,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So all I have to do
is bring Sasuke back?</font>

83
00:05:46,150 --> 00:05:47,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as there aren't
any enemies around</font>

84
00:05:47,910 --> 00:05:50,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that shouldn't be
too much of a hassle...</font>

85
00:05:50,950 --> 00:05:56,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... However not only is time
of the essence on this mission</font>

86
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it may turn into something
quite difficult.</font>

87
00:05:58,960 --> 00:05:59,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

88
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:02,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is a strong possibility that</font>

89
00:06:02,630 --> 00:06:05,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">those under the control of Orochimaru
are guiding Sasuke.</font>

90
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is turning into a real pain
in the neck.</font>

91
00:06:09,890 --> 00:06:16,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy... I held him in high respect
in so many different ways...</font>

92
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:22,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case please give me
a four-man team</font>

93
00:06:22,900 --> 00:06:25,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">composed only of Jonin and Chunin.</font>

94
00:06:26,940 --> 00:06:28,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm afraid I can't do that...</font>

95
00:06:28,820 --> 00:06:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! Why?!</font>

96
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:32,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You already know
the answer to that...</font>

97
00:06:33,870 --> 00:06:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now only the barest minimum
number of Jonin have been left behind</font>

98
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the others have all
left the village on missions.</font>

99
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Within the next 30 minutes</font>

100
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:51,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to gather all the Genin you
consider the best and leave this village!</font>

101
00:07:01,230 --> 00:07:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a drag but...</font>

102
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:06,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know the guy
so I just can't just let the matter go.</font>

103
00:07:07,110 --> 00:07:09,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What shall be shall be...</font>

104
00:07:13,370 --> 00:07:17,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's one guy
I want to recommend.</font>

105
00:07:18,330 --> 00:07:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What! You've gotta be kidding!</font>

106
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:25,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are such a drag starting
so early in the morning...</font>

107
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:28,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why this guy?</font>

108
00:07:32,090 --> 00:07:34,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That jerk!</font>

109
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, just wait here!</font>

110
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:38,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll change my clothes immediately!</font>

111
00:07:42,730 --> 00:07:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So do you have your eye...</font>

112
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:46,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on any other guys besides me
who are excellent?</font>

113
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

114
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:51,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wake up! Hey!</font>

115
00:07:51,990 --> 00:07:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said excellent guys, right...</font>

116
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:56,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't be helped...</font>

117
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:02,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Potato chips?</font>

118
00:08:03,750 --> 00:08:06,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're barbecued meat flavor...
you help out too!</font>

119
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:07,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

120
00:08:15,260 --> 00:08:16,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here he comes!</font>

121
00:08:20,220 --> 00:08:21,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it is just potato chips,</font>

122
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:24,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let anybody else have
the last piece no matter who you are.</font>

123
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:29,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji and I have worked as
a team for many years</font>

124
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:32,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so coordinating with him
is easiest for me.</font>

125
00:08:34,490 --> 00:08:36,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand that</font>

126
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:39,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but in this kind of situation
one would normally ask Shino first!</font>

127
00:08:40,660 --> 00:08:42,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, shut up.</font>

128
00:08:49,380 --> 00:08:51,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fat chance...!</font>

129
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:04,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino is on a special mission
with his father.</font>

130
00:09:05,730 --> 00:09:07,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... don't tell me...</font>

131
00:09:07,940 --> 00:09:09,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. He's in.</font>

132
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:10,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...!</font>

133
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:16,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... Sounds interesting...</font>

134
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:20,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like it was worth getting up early
and going for a walk, doesn't it?</font>

135
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru, what about the other guys?</font>

136
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:26,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to take my time to look for some
but we're pressed for time.</font>

137
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we don't find anybody else
by the time we leave the village</font>

138
00:09:30,750 --> 00:09:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it will be just us!</font>

139
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:35,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears that your operation
was a success.</font>

140
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:37,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

141
00:09:37,470 --> 00:09:39,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it okay for you
to be released already?</font>

142
00:09:40,050 --> 00:09:44,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was told that I would be able
to undertake light training soon.</font>

143
00:09:45,350 --> 00:09:46,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

144
00:09:57,660 --> 00:09:58,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

145
00:09:59,030 --> 00:10:03,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a hassle
but the more people the better...</font>

146
00:10:06,250 --> 00:10:09,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... At a time like this I...</font>

147
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:16,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee! Do what you need to do.</font>

148
00:10:36,490 --> 00:10:39,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll climb these steps alone
starting tomorrow!</font>

149
00:10:40,820 --> 00:10:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

150
00:10:43,950 --> 00:10:46,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be fine! You go!</font>

151
00:10:55,630 --> 00:10:57,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're at our time limit!</font>

152
00:11:03,050 --> 00:11:05,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I've assembled five people...</font>

153
00:11:12,230 --> 00:11:15,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Everybody follow me!</font>

154
00:11:20,570 --> 00:11:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

155
00:11:21,910 --> 00:11:23,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto...</font>

156
00:11:23,780 --> 00:11:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm supposed to be the squad leader.
Though it sure is a drag...</font>

157
00:11:29,210 --> 00:11:32,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really think everything will be okay
if things are left in your hands?</font>

158
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:34,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't seem very reliable...</font>

159
00:11:35,540 --> 00:11:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with you acting
like the boss, Naruto?</font>

160
00:11:39,220 --> 00:11:42,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although being ordered about by
some unmotivated guy like Shikamaru</font>

161
00:11:42,890 --> 00:11:45,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">doesn't sit right with me either...</font>

162
00:11:46,140 --> 00:11:49,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Shikamaru is already a Chunin!</font>

163
00:11:49,180 --> 00:11:51,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to follow his orders.</font>

164
00:11:52,270 --> 00:11:55,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What that means is that
the elders of the village recognized him</font>

165
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as capable of being a leader.</font>

166
00:11:58,900 --> 00:12:02,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since that's the case
come up with some strategy and plan.</font>

167
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From what I heard
there are enemies</font>

168
00:12:05,070 --> 00:12:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and there's a strong possibility
that they're gonna ambush us.</font>

169
00:12:08,490 --> 00:12:11,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a start
as this is a rescue operation</font>

170
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we will be in the position
of pursuit.</font>

171
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
the enemy can easily gain the initiative.</font>

172
00:12:17,750 --> 00:12:21,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore I will decide
on a deployment formation</font>

173
00:12:21,380 --> 00:12:23,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that will respond quickly
to any assault by the enemy.</font>

174
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you ignore me and
move of your own accord,</font>

175
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:28,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we will all die.</font>

176
00:12:31,850 --> 00:12:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will go in a single file formation.</font>

177
00:12:35,150 --> 00:12:38,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First of all,
the all-important spearhead will be...</font>

178
00:12:40,190 --> 00:12:41,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba, that's you!</font>

179
00:12:43,650 --> 00:12:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You and Akamaru go on
walks year round</font>

180
00:12:45,910 --> 00:12:48,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and are therefore well-versed in the terrain
and geography of the Land of Fire.</font>

181
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:50,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And since your nose is
very sensitive</font>

182
00:12:50,790 --> 00:12:52,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can track Sasuke
with your sense of smell and</font>

183
00:12:52,910 --> 00:12:55,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can distinguish booby traps
that carry the enemy's scent</font>

184
00:12:55,580 --> 00:12:56,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which makes them
easy to find...</font>

185
00:12:57,710 --> 00:13:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And moreover you and Akamaru as
a pair will be extremely efficient</font>

186
00:13:01,460 --> 00:13:05,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in compensating for the weakness
of a single file formation to assault.</font>

187
00:13:07,390 --> 00:13:10,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... second in line will be me
the squad leader.</font>

188
00:13:10,930 --> 00:13:13,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can give orders
as required in any situation</font>

189
00:13:13,850 --> 00:13:15,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from my position
directly behind Kiba</font>

190
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:19,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and can give orders to those behind me
using only hand signals.</font>

191
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:23,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And in the middle...
in the number three position is Naruto.</font>

192
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:27,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The middle position is
the best for you</font>

193
00:13:27,450 --> 00:13:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">since you're capable
of executing quick moves</font>

194
00:13:29,580 --> 00:13:32,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and are able to respond immediately
to anything in front or behind.</font>

195
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:36,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the cornerstone...
And you have Shadow Clones too.</font>

196
00:13:38,250 --> 00:13:40,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And fourth in line is Choji.</font>

197
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You. You don't have speed</font>

198
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:46,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but your ability to strike is the best
among the squad members.</font>

199
00:13:47,180 --> 00:13:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Line leader Kiba, I, and Naruto
will launch a surprise attack</font>

200
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I'll use you to launch
the deciding blow.</font>

201
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:54,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, your role is
to attack the routed enemy.</font>

202
00:13:55,390 --> 00:13:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then on the tail end
will be you, Neji...</font>

203
00:13:58,100 --> 00:14:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are assigned to
the most difficult position of rear lookout.</font>

204
00:14:02,730 --> 00:14:04,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will use your Byakugan
to constantly check</font>

205
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:06,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that there are no loopholes
in the ranks.</font>

206
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:13,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it? Take a careful look at this.</font>

207
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:23,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Use this diagram to verify
the radius of your assigned watch.</font>

208
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:26,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba watches the front,</font>

209
00:14:26,510 --> 00:14:28,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm responsible for
a wide forward view,</font>

210
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:34,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto watches left, Choji right
and Neji...</font>

211
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Using your Byakugan
you cover the entire area to the rear.</font>

212
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:42,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to familiarize myself
with our current military potential.</font>

213
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:47,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me check all the Ninja equipment
each of you currently has...</font>

214
00:14:47,610 --> 00:14:49,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will commit that
to memory straight away.</font>

215
00:14:49,990 --> 00:14:51,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Any questions?</font>

216
00:14:54,490 --> 00:14:56,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though he just assembled
his men a short while ago</font>

217
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's already created
the best possible formation...</font>

218
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:04,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If not, I want to tell you
the most important thing last.</font>

219
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke and I aren't close friends.</font>

220
00:15:12,930 --> 00:15:15,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In fact, I don't particularly like him.</font>

221
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:23,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, he is also a Shinobi belonging
to the Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

222
00:15:24,060 --> 00:15:25,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is a comrade!</font>

223
00:15:25,690 --> 00:15:27,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, I will put my life
on the line to help him!</font>

224
00:15:28,490 --> 00:15:30,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the way
of the Leaf Village.</font>

225
00:15:31,070 --> 00:15:35,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In this case even I can't just sit back
and be a sluggard.</font>

226
00:15:37,410 --> 00:15:40,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I am responsible
for your lives.</font>

227
00:15:44,130 --> 00:15:49,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow... You're acting kind of
like a Chunin, aren't you?!</font>

228
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:54,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay then, as soon as he's checked
our Ninja tools we'll depart.</font>

229
00:15:54,890 --> 00:15:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody take out your Ninja tools.</font>

230
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:08,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke wouldn't fall victim
to that kind of guy's enticement...</font>

231
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's already
a really powerful guy</font>

232
00:16:10,990 --> 00:16:15,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so he wouldn't need to do
that kind of thing! I guarantee it!</font>

233
00:16:19,040 --> 00:16:22,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... Why Sasuke...?!</font>

234
00:16:23,250 --> 00:16:25,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's go!</font>

235
00:16:25,250 --> 00:16:26,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

236
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:32,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

237
00:16:34,380 --> 00:16:36,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard the whole story
from Hokage-sama.</font>

238
00:16:36,890 --> 00:16:39,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry but I can't take you along
on this mission.</font>

239
00:16:40,970 --> 00:16:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even you weren't able
to convince Sasuke, right?</font>

240
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:50,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All that can be done now is for us
to use force to convince him...</font>

241
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:54,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, your role in this has ended.</font>

242
00:16:58,370 --> 00:17:01,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means Sakura-chan,
that you and Sasuke...?!</font>

243
00:17:06,630 --> 00:17:07,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san...</font>

244
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:22,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... This is a...
once in a lifetime request...</font>

245
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please bring...
please bring Sasuke-kun back.</font>

246
00:17:30,320 --> 00:17:36,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't do it!
I wasn't able to stop Sasuke-kun!</font>

247
00:17:37,740 --> 00:17:42,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this point the only person
who would be able to stop Sasuke-kun...</font>

248
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:44,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who would be able to save him...</font>

249
00:17:45,540 --> 00:17:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is you... Naruto...</font>

250
00:17:59,140 --> 00:18:02,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You like Sasuke so much
don't you, Sakura-chan?</font>

251
00:18:04,270 --> 00:18:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand to my very core</font>

252
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">how painful it must be
for you right now Sakura-chan.</font>

253
00:18:14,690 --> 00:18:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, there's one thing
I want to ask you.</font>

254
00:18:18,570 --> 00:18:19,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

255
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How do you feel about... Naruto?</font>

256
00:18:24,870 --> 00:18:28,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thwarting someone's love seems
to have become natural to him.</font>

257
00:18:28,750 --> 00:18:31,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He actually seems to be enjoying
my suffering.</font>

258
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto doesn't understand
the least thing about me.</font>

259
00:18:35,630 --> 00:18:36,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just annoying.</font>

260
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:52,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... thank you...</font>

261
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:59,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bring Sasuke back without fail!
I promise that on my life!</font>

262
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:06,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You always understood me...</font>

263
00:19:07,330 --> 00:19:10,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You always helped me...</font>

264
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:15,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

265
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:22,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, Naruto!</font>

266
00:19:23,010 --> 00:19:26,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really think you're gonna be okay
saying that kind of thing?!</font>

267
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:29,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure! I will not go back on my word.</font>

268
00:19:29,850 --> 00:19:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my Ninja Way!</font>

269
00:19:32,060 --> 00:19:35,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's hurry up and go!</font>

270
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've lost a little time...
Let's hurry!</font>

271
00:19:40,030 --> 00:19:41,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

272
00:19:56,880 --> 00:19:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun struck the pose of
a nice guy as he said that...</font>

273
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:01,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll all be all right now.</font>

274
00:20:03,010 --> 00:20:05,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm positive...
I'm positive that it will all go well!</font>

275
00:20:23,660 --> 00:20:26,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-sama... Around here will do
don't you think?</font>

276
00:20:26,990 --> 00:20:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've already exited
the Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

277
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:31,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is that?</font>

278
00:20:32,910 --> 00:20:34,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To tell you the truth</font>

279
00:20:34,210 --> 00:20:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama has given us
one important task...</font>

280
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... what is it?</font>

281
00:20:58,690 --> 00:21:02,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will be necessary for you
to die once...</font>

282
00:21:08,090 --> 00:21:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b>GET UP aa sumimasen</b></font></font></font>

283
00:21:08,090 --> 00:21:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b>get up! oh, I'm sorry</b></font></font></font>

284
00:21:13,060 --> 00:21:20,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#dc959b"><b>goku tama ni boku tama ni</b></font></font></font>

285
00:21:13,060 --> 00:21:20,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#77dc93"><b>once in a long while, once in a while</b></font></font></font>

286
00:21:20,410 --> 00:21:26,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#dc959b"><b>yume ni yabureru hito no kakera ga</b></font></font></font>

287
00:21:20,410 --> 00:21:26,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#77dc93"><b>the remnants of a person broken by dreams</b></font></font></font>

288
00:21:26,080 --> 00:21:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#dc959b"><b>yama no you ni mieru</b></font></font></font>

289
00:21:26,080 --> 00:21:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#77dc93"><b></b></font></font></font>

290
00:21:27,910 --> 00:21:31,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#f0d6a3"><b>yama no you ni mieru</b></font></font></font>

291
00:21:27,910 --> 00:21:31,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#80e9eb"><b></b></font></font></font>

292
00:21:34,450 --> 00:21:41,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#f0d6a3"><b>kamisama ni hotokesama ni</b></font></font></font>

